  "_qiyu": "奇遇 — a situation and two or three ways (the Spire's ? rooms). The rules decide what each way does, from this data: `chance` of the good side (else `miss`), each side's effects — `hp` a share of the run's 气血 (minus hurts), `boon` (`any`: one drawn), `loot` rolls of the 重's drop table, `wealth` 灵石. `frame` and each side's `line` are the page's facts; 银月 says it in her own words when she is awake beside him (the page hands her the facts), and the line stands when she is not.",
